# Process maps and their config bundles are NOT source (WI-002111).
# A map ships between sites through Processa's own export/import, which carries
# the diagram, its Server Scripts and its workflow states together and compiles
# on arrival. A .bpmn committed here is a copy that silently goes stale the
# moment someone edits the map in the modeler, and there is nothing to reconcile
# the two. Patch only the AI Agent Configuration; never the map.
one_bpmn/exports/*.bpmn
one_bpmn/exports/*_config.json
